    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>Last updated: July 2026</p>
    <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>We collect minimal information: email addresses for newsletter subscriptions, and anonymous analytics data (page views, referral sources). We do not sell your data.</p>
