    <h2>Affiliate Links</h2>
    <p>Some links on this site are affiliate links. We may earn a commission if you make a purchase through these links, at no additional cost to you.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>For privacy-related inquiries, contact us via our contact page.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>